message: "If you use Taala in research, please cite it as below."
title: "Taala: a password strength checker for Hinglish passwords"
type: software
version: 0.1.0b1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Paraxanos/Taala"
authors:
  - alias: "Paraxanos"
abstract: >-
  Estimates the strength of Hinglish (romanized Hindi) passwords independent of
  spelling and script, on top of zxcvbn. Early beta; not security-reviewed.
keywords:
  - passwords
  - zxcvbn
  - Hinglish
  - password strength
